                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15/465: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chief of the American Representation on the Preparatory Commission</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-04-07T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 7, 1927—6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>110. Your telegram No. 221, April 6, 5 p.m. Navy Department does not find
                    acceptable the principle of limitation of naval effectives.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
